    {
      "id": "session:2026-10-13-265f3d59",
      "type": "Session",
      "label": "v0.2 re-scoped to the evidence phase; CI, consistency and queries",
      "description": "Goal: Fold external feedback into the plan and implement the v0.2 base: #42, #37, #36, #38.\nInstructions: Do everything that does not need the user; the benchmark waits for a go-ahead because it costs money.\nDiscoveries: External feedback: a short bounded phase to get evidence that kg solves a problem. The user adds topic-specific graphs and old-against-recent commits to #39. Pushing workflow files needs a token with the workflow scope.\nAccomplished: #41 (project site) opened as a proposal; requirements 1.2 drafted and v0.2 re-scoped (#43, PR #44); CI with a clean-install smoke test (#45); consistent extraction and kg status (#46); mandatory descriptions (#47); kg query and kg impact (#48).\nNext steps: Run the benchmark (#39) once the user decides how to pay for the model calls; then #40.\nRelevant files: docs/requirements.md, docs/roadmap.md, .github/workflows/ci.yml, src/kg/update.py, src/kg/query.py",
      "attrs": {
