    {
      "id": "decision:v02-evidence-phase",
      "type": "Decision",
      "label": "v0.2 becomes a short evidence phase",
      "description": "What: v0.2 is re-scoped to queries, a graph that stays consistent with the code, CI and a benchmark of an agent with and without the graph, time-boxed to about two weeks. Deduplication, export, hooks and history, MCP, calls and the Dockerfile move to v0.3.\nWhy: External feedback (2026-10-13) asked for evidence that kg solves a problem; the old v0.2 was too broad and lacked stale-graph detection, coverage limits, CI and a benchmark as success criterion.\nWhere: docs/requirements.md 1.2, PA-05; docs/roadmap.md",
      "attrs": {
        "created": "2026-10-13",
        "session": "session:2026-10-13-265f3d59",
        "status": "active"
      },
      "provenance": {
