      }
    },
    {
      "id": "decision:benchmark-first",
      "type": "Decision",
      "label": "The benchmark is the most valuable item of v0.2",
      "description": "What: Order for v0.2: #38 (the minimum kg query and kg impact the graph agent needs), then the benchmark #39, then the demo #40; #37 and #42 alongside. A negative result is a valid outcome.",
