      "id": "decision:full-rebuild-parser-layer",
      "type": "Decision",
      "label": "A full rebuild of the parser layer is enough (RF-72)",
      "description": "What: `kg extract` replaces the parser layer in one atomic write, keeping llm and manual knowledge; agent edges whose endpoints disappeared are reported. Processing only changed files became RF-78, for v0.3.\nWhy: A full extraction takes seconds; incremental extraction is an optimisation, needed only if full updates become slow (RNF-06).\nWhere: docs/requirements.md RF-72, RF-78; docs/extract.md",
      "attrs": {
        "created": "2026-10-13",
        "session": "session:2026-10-13-265f3d59",
